# {'name': 'replace_file_content', 'args': {'AllowMultiple': 'false', 'Description': '"Add milestone 16 to progress.md"', 'EndLine': '43', 'Instruction': '"Add milestone 16 for User Cloud Dashboard to the Master Summary"', 'ReplacementContent': '"40: 16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext` and a slide-over `MyStashDashboardDrawer` attached to the user avatar in the Navbar. Secured checkout flows and synced meal token balance directly against the Supabase `meal_wallets` table.\\n41: \\n42: ---\\n43: \\n44: ## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE"', 'StartLine': '40', 'TargetContent': '"40: \\n41: ---\\n42: \\n43: ## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE"', 'TargetFile': '"d:\\\\MEmu Photo\\\\stashsaarthi-web\\\\progress.md"', 'TargetLintErrorIds': '[]', 'toolAction': '"Update progress.md"', 'toolSummary': '"Replace file content"'}}

# {'name': 'replace_file_content', 'args': {'AllowMultiple': 'false', 'Description': '"Add milestone 16 to progress.md"', 'EndLine': '43', 'Instruction': '"Add milestone 16 to the master summary"', 'ReplacementContent': '"15. **Homepage Information Architecture (IA) Refactor:** Stripped God-tab complexities and consolidated the experience into 3 primary tabs (`storage`, `rooms`, `khana`). Refactored `TokenMealHub` complex configuration flows into a slide-over `Sheet` drawer. Cleaned `Navbar` links to focus exclusively on the 3 core tabs. Rebuilt `MascotGuide` as a state-aware interactive AI avatar. Passed strict build and TS compilation checks.\\n16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext` and a slide-over `MyStashDashboardDrawer` attached to the user avatar in the Navbar. Secured checkout flows and synced meal token balance directly against the Supabase `meal_wallets` table.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE"', 'StartLine': '39', 'TargetContent': '"15. **Homepage Information Architecture (IA) Refactor:** Stripped God-tab complexities and consolidated the experience into 3 primary tabs (`storage`, `rooms`, `khana`). Refactored `TokenMealHub` complex configuration flows into a slide-over `Sheet` drawer. Cleaned `Navbar` links to focus exclusively on the 3 core tabs. Rebuilt `MascotGuide` as a state-aware interactive AI avatar. Passed strict build and TS compilation checks.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE"', 'TargetFile': '"d:\\\\MEmu Photo\\\\stashsaarthi-web\\\\progress.md"', 'TargetLintErrorIds': '[]', 'toolAction': '"Update progress.md"', 'toolSummary': '"Replace file content"'}}

