# {'name': 'replace_file_content', 'args': {'AllowMultiple': 'false', 'Description': '"Update progress.md"', 'EndLine': '51', 'Instruction': '"Update Milestone 16 and Active Directives to mark UserActivityDrawer and Cross-Device persistence as done."', 'ReplacementContent': '"39: 15. **Homepage Information Architecture (IA) Refactor:** Stripped God-tab complexities and consolidated the experience into 3 primary tabs (`storage`, `rooms`, `khana`). Refactored `TokenMealHub` complex configuration flows into a slide-over `Sheet` drawer. Cleaned `Navbar` links to focus exclusively on the 3 core tabs. Rebuilt `MascotGuide` as a state-aware interactive AI avatar. Passed strict build and TS compilation checks.\\n40: 16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext`. Built the new `UserActivityDrawer` slide-over (My Saarthi Pass) attached to the user avatar in the Navbar, fetching and displaying Active Stash Passes, My Room Visits, Liquidation Deals, and an Activity Timeline. Gated interactions across all 3 domains (`StorageServiceTab`, `TokenMealHub`, `RoomsServiceTab`) using `useRequireAuthAction` and synced `user_activity_logs` directly against the Supabase DB.\\n41: \\n42: ---\\n43: \\n44: ## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE\\n45: \\n46: - **Primary Focus:** Kanpur Campus Market Testing & Pilot Onboarding\\n47: - **Top 3 Pending Tasks:**\\n48:   1. **Field Testing & QR Flyer Deployments:** Real student test bookings across Allen/Motion coaching hubs in Kakadeo and CSJMU hostels.\\n49:   2. **WhatsApp / SMS Gateway Verification:** Edge-triggered instant SMS/WhatsApp alerts for booking inquiries and host confirmations.\\n50:   3. **Live Host Escrow Verification:** Validating initial batch of 20+ verified host rooms & luggage storage spots for summer/vacation demand."', 'StartLine': '39', 'TargetContent': '"39: 15. **Homepage Information Architecture (IA) Refactor:** Stripped God-tab complexities and consolidated the experience into 3 primary tabs (`storage`, `rooms`, `khana`). Refactored `TokenMealHub` complex configuration flows into a slide-over `Sheet` drawer. Cleaned `Navbar` links to focus exclusively on the 3 core tabs. Rebuilt `MascotGuide` as a state-aware interactive AI avatar. Passed strict build and TS compilation checks.\\n40: 16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext` and a slide-over `MyStashDashboardDrawer` attached to the user avatar in the Navbar. Secured checkout flows and synced meal token balance directly against the Supabase `meal_wallets` table.\\n41: \\n42: ---\\n43: \\n44: ## 4. ACTIVE DIRECTIVE\\n45: \\n46: - **Primary Focus:** Kanpur Campus Market Testing & Pilot Onboarding\\n47: - **Top 3 Pending Tasks:**\\n48:   1. **Field Testing & QR Flyer Deployments:** Real student test bookings across Allen/Motion coaching hubs in Kakadeo and CSJMU hostels.\\n49:   2. **WhatsApp / SMS Gateway Verification:** Edge-triggered instant SMS/WhatsApp alerts for booking inquiries and host confirmations.\\n50:   3. **Live Host Escrow Verification:** Validating initial batch of 20+ verified host rooms & luggage storage spots for summer/vacation demand.\\n51: "', 'TargetFile': '"d:\\\\MEmu Photo\\\\stashsaarthi-web\\\\progress.md"', 'TargetLintErrorIds': '[]', 'toolAction': '"Update progress.md"', 'toolSummary': '"Replace file content"'}}

# {'name': 'replace_file_content', 'args': {'AllowMultiple': 'false', 'Description': '"Update progress.md"', 'EndLine': '40', 'Instruction': '"Update Milestone 16"', 'ReplacementContent': '"16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext` and a slide-over `UserActivityDrawer` (\\"My Saarthi Pass\\") attached to the user avatar in the Navbar. Fetches and displays Active Stash Passes, My Room Visits, Liquidation Deals, and an Activity Timeline. Gated interactions across all 3 domains (`StorageServiceTab`, `TokenMealHub`, `RoomsServiceTab`) using `useRequireAuthAction` and synced `user_activity_logs` directly against the Supabase DB."', 'StartLine': '40', 'TargetContent': '"16. **User Cloud Dashboard & Persistent Identity:** Implemented cross-device data hydration via `UserCloudContext` and a slide-over `MyStashDashboardDrawer` attached to the user avatar in the Navbar. Secured checkout flows and synced meal token balance directly against the Supabase `meal_wallets` table."', 'TargetFile': '"d:\\\\MEmu Photo\\\\stashsaarthi-web\\\\progress.md"', 'TargetLintErrorIds': '[]', 'toolAction': '"Update progress.md"', 'toolSummary': '"Replace file content"'}}

