# {'name': 'replace_file_content', 'args': {'AllowMultiple': 'false', 'Description': '"Explicitly mention DPDP Act 2023 in Privacy Policy"', 'EndLine': '149', 'Instruction': '"Update privacy policy to explicitly mention DPDP Act 2023 compliance."', 'ReplacementContent': '"  privacy: {\\n    title: \\"Privacy Policy (DPDP Act 2023 Compliant)\\",\\n    title_hi: \\"गोपनीयता नीति (DPDP Act 2023 के अनुरूप)\\",\\n    body: [\\n      \\"1. Zero Data Monetization: We never sell, rent, lease, or distribute your phone number, email, or identity documents to third parties, telemarketers, or advertising networks.\\",\\n      \\"2. Purpose of Collection: We collect only the data required to facilitate safe node custody and booking clearance (Name, College/Aadhaar proof, and campus location).\\",\\n      \\"3. Encryption & Storage: All personal records are encrypted at rest and in transit. Temporary check-in photo logs are retained only during the active custody period.\\",\\n      \\"4. Right to Erasure & DPDP Compliance: You have full ownership of your data under the Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023 and can request permanent account and document deletion at any time by emailing privacy@stashsaarthi.in.\\",\\n      \\"5. Predictive AI & Telemetry Governance: Client-side neural network models run 100% locally in browser memory for asset pre-loading with zero server-side PII or biometric profiling. Opt-out anytime via Low-Data Mode.\\",\\n    ],\\n    body_hi: [\\n      \\"1. शून्य डेटा बिक्री: हम आपके फोन नंबर, ईमेल या पहचान दस्तावेजों को कभी किसी तीसरे पक्ष, टेलीमार्केटर या विज्ञापन नेटवर्क को नहीं बेचते या साझा नहीं करते।\\",\\n      \\"2. संग्रह का उद्देश्य: हम केवल सुरक्षित नोड कस्टडी और बुकिंग सत्यापन के लिए आवश्यक डेटा (नाम, कॉलेज/आधार प्रमाण और स्थान) एकत्र करते हैं।\\",\\n      \\"3. एन्क्रिप्\n<truncated 1301 bytes>', 'StartLine': '133', 'TargetContent': '"  privacy: {\\n    title: \\"Privacy Policy (Plain English)\\",\\n    title_hi: \\"गोपनीयता नीति (स